T3 Code Iroh native transport

The generated declaration file src/upstream.d.ts is from n0-computer/iroh-ffi,
commit 3103bf5295be6d50c5272ff7a426e9b539f3f587, licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.
The corresponding licenses are preserved in licenses/. The build script copies
these notices beside the locally built native addon. Native binaries are not
checked in. See build.mjs for the exact source and locked build command.

Local declaration changes expose clearIpTransports and correct EndpointId
comments to the hexadecimal representation verified against the pinned runtime.
The local Rust patch also makes receive stop and send reset interrupt pending
operations before taking the stream mutex, and exposes relay-only transport.
